          <p class="product-desc">A local-first compliance platform that helps teams generate policies, run risk assessments, manage frameworks, and export audit-ready documents — all powered by your own Google Gemini API key, running entirely on your device. Manage GDPR, SOC 2, NIST, EU AI Act, and more. Generate structured, compliant policies with AI, run AI-powered risk assessments, auto-remediate compliance gaps, and export policies and audit reports to PDF. Share verified documents through secure tokenized links. Includes a Document Library, Verified Link Trust Center, and Auto-Remediation Co-Pilot. No cloud backend — offline-friendly with a 30-day grace period, encrypted local SQLite + AES-256-GCM storage, and OS-level secret encryption.</p>
