        <div class="card-body">
          <span class="badge">Family Planner</span>
          <h2 class="product-title">Wheel of Fate — Fun Family Planner</h2>
          <p class="product-desc">A playful, gamified weekly planner that helps families decide together, spin together, and win together. Wheel of Fate transforms ordinary weekly planning into a fun, collaborative experience — whether you're organizing chores, planning outings, or settling family debates. Includes a Home Dashboard, Family Roster & Leadership with a rotating weekly Captain, Weekly Setup, Rewards & Prizes, Parent Night Out, Family Night Out, Family Journal, and Weekly Tracker with end-of-week review. When consensus is tough, spin the wheel and let fate decide. Just download the files, open the folder, and launch index.html in your browser — no installation, no setup. Makes chores fun, reduces arguments, encourages teamwork, and helps kids feel involved and empowered.</p>
