          <h2 class="product-title">BundleCraft — Product Bundling & Listing Engine</h2>
          <p class="product-desc">A desktop-first product bundling and listing engine for Etsy sellers, digital shop owners, and e-commerce entrepreneurs. Combine multiple products into optimized bundles, generate SEO-friendly titles, descriptions, and tags with AI (OpenAI or Google Gemini BYOK), sync optional Printify inventory, analyze pricing to maximize profit margins, and export "Etsy-Ready" listings instantly. Local-first — no cloud backend, encrypted API keys, full data ownership.</p>
